bds 4,0 "Selected vertical intention"
date 2026-10-14
preamble
    Selected vertical intention, reported by the flight management system.
    Source: ICAO Doc 9871 Table A-2-31.

items

    MCPALTSTATUS "MCP Altitude Status"
        definition
            Validity of the MCP/FCU selected altitude value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid
        remark
            When 0, MCPALT should be ignored.

    MCPALT "MCP/FCU Selected Altitude"
        definition
            Selected altitude from the Mode Control Panel / Flight Control Unit.
        element 12
            unsigned quantity 16 "ft"
        remark
            MSB = 32768 ft, LSB = 16 ft.

    FMSALTSTATUS "FMS Altitude Status"
        definition
            Validity of the FMS selected altitude value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    FMSALT "FMS Selected Altitude"
        definition
            Selected altitude from the Flight Management System vertical profile.
        element 12
            unsigned quantity 16 "ft"

    BPSTATUS "Barometric Pressure Status"
        definition
            Validity of the barometric pressure setting value.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not valid
                1: Valid

    BP "Barometric Pressure Setting"
        definition
            Barometric pressure setting (QNH).
        element 12
            unsigned quantity 1/10 "mb"
        remark
            Actual value is raw * 0.1 + 800 mb.

    spare 8

    MODESTATUS "Status of MCP/FCU Mode Bits"
        definition
            Validity of the MCP/FCU mode bits (VNAV, ALTHOLD, APP).
        element 1
            table
                0: No mode information provided
                1: Mode information provided

    VNAV "VNAV Mode"
        definition
            VNAV mode active.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not active
                1: Active

    ALTHOLD "ALT HOLD Mode"
        definition
            Altitude hold mode active.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not active
                1: Active

    APP "APPROACH Mode"
        definition
            Approach mode active.
        element 1
            table
                0: Not active
                1: Active

    spare 2

    TARGETALTSTATUS "Status of Target Altitude Source"
        definition
            Validity of the target altitude source bits.
        element 1
            table
                0: No source information provided
                1: Source information provided

    TARGETALTSOURCE "Target Altitude Source"
        definition
            Source of the target (short-term intent) altitude.
        element 2
            table
                0: Unknown
                1: Aircraft altitude
                2: FCU/MCP selected altitude
                3: FMS selected altitude
